        "cooked": "<p>So, I’m mucking around with some character sheets for the Terror Forms one-shot, and I find myself unable to remember whether we’ve been given any information about Parse post-OblivAeon, aside from “a member of the Paradigms”.</p>\n<p>Just before OblivAeon, Parse went Fugue State and got both kind of messed up and extremely analytical even by her prior standards, but have Christopher and Adam said anything in a podcast that I’ve forgotten about what she’s like in the Universe 1 era?</p>",
