        "id": 254360,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-10-04T22:40:24.618Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think all we’ve gotten and what hasn’t been disproven yet is from her episode</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>Sentinel Comics Universe - she continues her friendship with Benchmark and joins the Paradigm team alongside him and Unity.  This is what was alluded to earlier with regards to the “traffic controller” question as it kind of represents the writers <em>finally</em> figuring out what to do with her. She still gets out in the field occasionally, but more often she’s the person providing an overview and acting as a dispatcher of sorts for the Paradigms. She’s got a tablet here too, but she’s using it to control actual drones and whatnot so she can get a good view of what’s going on.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2023-10-04T22:40:24.618Z",
